<title>USA: IPO FILING - Star Telecommunications Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Star Telecommunications Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Star Telecommunications Inc</p>
<p> Stock symbol			   STRX.O</p>
<p> Estimated price range	   $8-$10/shr</p>
<p> Total shares to be offered    6.5 million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by company	 5.5 million</p>
<p> Shrs offered by shareholders  1.0 million</p>
<p> Shrs outstanding after ipo    23,238,651</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter    Hambrecht &amp; Quist</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  975,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Based in Santa Barbara, Calif., Star is an international long-distance provider offering switched voice services on a wholesale basis mainly to U.S.-based long distance carriers.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: To repay debt and for capital expenditures,</p>
<p>working capital and general corporate purposes.</p>
<p> Financial Data in 000s:     1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $16,125	     $208,086</p>
<p>   - Net Income (loss)	(568)		   868</p>
